message: "If you use karml, please cite it as below (and the associated paper once published)."
title: "karml"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
# date-released is refreshed to the release day by the release script right before the tag is created.
date-released: 2026-11-18
abstract: >-
  karml (pronounced Karamell) combines CHARMM MLpot and JAX-MD with JAX-based neural models (PhysNet, DCMNet and others)
  for hybrid machine-learned/molecular-mechanics (ML/MM) condensed-phase simulations.
